# an aspect can't be imported: only a module can (D-126, D-179)
** spec: semantics/modules.md#what-a-module-may-contain
primary aspect c24_import_aspect is
  from lib use (tool);                ** compile error: tool is an aspect, not a module

  process main is
    print "never";
  return;
end c24_import_aspect;
